Adapted parts:
  - src/server/core/permissions.ts — permission prompt detection from the terminal
  - hooks/tether-hook.sh — the approach of forwarding Claude Code hook events to a
    local server (rewritten to depend only on bash and curl)
  - the tmux session model (one Claude Code process per tmux session) and the
    status-line forwarding idea

The dashboard's visual style is original work. It is inspired by editorial
storefront designs. No third-party design code is included. UI primitives follow
the open patterns of shadcn/ui (MIT) and Radix UI (MIT).
